# Per-environment identifiers live in the Fastfile (dev vs prod bundle
# ID/package name differ by build configuration/type — see
# ios_app_identifier / android_package_name in each lane below) rather than
# here, since Appfile constants are evaluated once for the whole run and
# can't vary per-lane.
#
# team_id / itc_team_id: set via ASC_TEAM_ID / ASC_TEAM_ID env vars in CI
# (values are Apple-account-specific and not committed).
team_id(ENV["ASC_TEAM_ID"]) if ENV["ASC_TEAM_ID"]
itc_team_id(ENV["ASC_TEAM_ID"]) if ENV["ASC_TEAM_ID"]

# json_key_file for Play Console (supply) — set per-lane instead of here so
# CI can point at a path written from a secret at runtime; see
# GOOGLE_PLAY_JSON_KEY_PATH in the Android lanes.
